# recurrences, closed forms and loop sums checked by direct iteration
closed sum(i, 1, n, i)
closed sum(i, 1, n, i^2)
closed sum(i, 1, n, i^3)
closed sum(i, 0, n, 2^i)
closed prod(i, 1, n, i)
x[0] = 1; x[k+1] = 2*x[k]
closed x
f[0] = 0; f[1] = 1; f[k+2] = f[k+1] + f[k]
closed f
closed sum(i, 1, n, i*(i+1))
closed sum(i, 1, n, (2*i-1))
